    "description": "I currently serve as the principal Software Engineer and Project Manager to the agency’s Information and Technology Division. In this capacity, I've led the effort to modernize the software infrastructure of the agency including the redesign and development of mission critical applications. Specific tasks include:\n\nDevelopment and review of technical Statements of Work (SOW), evaluation of vendor’s responses, hiring and management of contractor team.\n\nDevelopment of technical infrastructure (server capacity, system topology, network requirements) needed to support the enterprise applications.\n\t\nServe as the agency technical liaison and manage the implementation of various interagency interfaces and data exchanges.\n\nManage the change control, enhancement requests and priorities of the agency’s business units and stakeholders. \n\nEstablish standards and processes to safeguard and manage the Agency’s technical assets including the case management system and sensitive client’s data.\n\nManage project schedules, risk assessment, stake holders communication and reporting to Agency’s Division Chiefs and Executives.",
